      "en": "Well-cared-for car offering balanced road manners, dependable mechanicals, and a comfortable cabin. Richly specified with cruise control, stylish alloy wheels, and air conditioning. Available for viewing in Oujda. Sound running order with up-to-date maintenance, ready to drive anywhere immediately.",
