      "en": "Solid, dependable vehicle kept in clean condition with careful ownership and honest maintenance history. Richly specified with air conditioning, touchscreen GPS navigation, and reversing camera and parking sensors. Available for viewing in Mohammedia. Sound running order with up-to-date maintenance, ready to drive anywhere immediately.",
