      "en": "Popular and economical hatchback renowned for outstanding fuel economy, low maintenance, and effortless parking. Richly specified with reversing camera and parking sensors, air conditioning, and touchscreen GPS navigation. Very low mileage with bodywork and interior in near-showroom condition. Available for viewing in Rabat. Sound running order with up-to-date maintenance, ready to drive anywhere immediately.",
