      "en": "Versatile family crossover featuring a commanding driving position, generous luggage space, and dependable road manner. Richly specified with stylish alloy wheels, air conditioning, and premium leather upholstery. Available for viewing in Marrakech. Sound running order with up-to-date maintenance, ready to drive anywhere immediately.",
